   "questionHtml": "מצאו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span> עבורו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span> מאונכים זה לזה.",
   "solutionHtml": "הוקטורים הנורמליים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span> הם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec N_1=(-k^2,-1,k+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec N_2=(1,k,2k-3)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. התנאי לכך ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span> מאונכים זה לזה הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec N_1\\cdot\\vec N_2=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מכאן נקבל:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec N_1\\cdot\\vec N_2=0\\Rightarrow(-k^2,-1,k+1)\\cdot(1,k,2k-3)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow -k^2-k+(k+1)(2k-3)=0\\Rightarrow k^2-2k-3=0\\Rightarrow k_1=-1,\\ k_2=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>כיוון שנתון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span> נקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
